","quantity":175,"unit":"g","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"175 g de pimientos de colores"},{"ingredientId":"tomate-cherry-de-color","quantity":175,"unit":"g","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"175 g de tomates Cherry de colores"}],"steps":[{"text":{"es":"Ponemos en un molde los pimientos y los tomates Cherry, una pizca de hierbas provenzales, otra de ajo en polvo y un poco de aceite en spray.","en":"Put the peppers and cherry tomatoes in a tin, with a pinch of herbes de Provence, a pinch of garlic powder and a little oil spray."}},{"text":{"es":"Colocamos el molde en el interior de la Cecofry y programamos 175ºC durante 12 minutos.","en":"Place the tin inside the Cecofry and cook at 175 °C for 12 minutes."},"timerMinutes":12,"temperatureC":175},{"text":{"es":"Servimos con la burrata en el medio, un poco de pipas y sésamo, vinagre balsámico y albahaca.","en":"Serve with the burrata in the middle, a few sunflower seeds and sesame seeds, balsamic vinegar and basil."}}]}